    "atom::d3acce1d97406cdc7f871998": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d3acce1d97406cdc7f871998",
      "source_handle": "P0443",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "1. 数据收集：纳入连续确诊的晚期NSCLC患者，收集基线粪便样本（ICI治疗前或首次给药后7天内），记录临床病理参数（PFS、PD-L1 IHC评分、化疗史、合并用药等）。2. 测序与分析：进行鸟枪法宏基因组测序，使用Kraken2进行物种注释，排除病毒和真核生物，仅保留细菌和古菌。3. 统计分析：使用Shannon指数评估α-多样性；使用UMAP和PERMANOVA评估β-多样性；使用Wilcoxon秩和检验进行差异丰度分析；构建Spearman相关性网络分析菌群互作。4. 预测建模：应用Lasso回归进行特征选择以规避过拟合，使用多变量Cox回归评估独立预测因子，并通过Kaplan-Meier曲线和Log-rank检验验证生存差异。5. 机器学习：构建随机森林模型，通过5折交叉验证评估基于分类学（物种）和代谢通路（MetaCyc数据库）的特征对PFS和PD-L1状态的预测性能（AUC值）。6. 验证：在独立的验证队列（n=60）中复现关键物种的预测价值。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c31875ff803ede933ad796c2326901f89f126369b513",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c404e9806cdb77de4b216030221f22c6bc64af00859c82789ee02e76b81837d3",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::fb59ad4bec4a4e24b5df0d65": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fb59ad4bec4a4e24b5df0d65",
      "source_handle": "P0443",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "在高加索NSCLC人群中，首次在物种水平上确认了*Alistipes*属（*A. shahii*, *A. finegoldii*）与长PFS的正向关联，以及*Streptococcus*属（*S. salivarius*, *S. vestibularis*）和*Bifidobacterium breve*与短PFS的负向关联，并在独立队列中进行了验证。",
        "limits": "研究为横断面观察性设计，无法确定菌群改变是疾病/治疗的结果还是原因。样本量相对较小（发现队列62人），且主要局限于高加索人群，外推至其他种族需谨慎。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c31875ff803ede933ad796c2326901f89f126369b513",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d59af70adbc6551785f0bb8cb084a5b4c25d22d41ebe991e0f352576c8114607",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::cdddca4347767666e81d60f7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cdddca4347767666e81d60f7",
      "source_handle": "P0443",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "揭示了肠道微生物组网络拓扑结构的差异：长PFS患者的菌群网络具有更高的连通性和中心性，提示有益菌之间的协同作用可能有助于维持免疫治疗响应。",
        "limits": "网络分析基于相关性，不能直接证明因果机制。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c31875ff803ede933ad796c2326901f89f126369b513",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d59af70adbc6551785f0bb8cb084a5b4c25d22d41ebe991e0f352576c8114607",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ded295799b0c5ea10e07292f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ded295799b0c5ea10e07292f",
      "source_handle": "P0443",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "区分了分类学特征与代谢功能在预测不同终点上的优势：分类学用于预测PFS，代谢通路用于预测PD-L1状态，为多维生物标志物开发提供了依据。",
        "limits": "代谢通路分析仅在37名患者的子集中进行，代表性可能受限。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c31875ff803ede933ad796c2326901f89f126369b513",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d59af70adbc6551785f0bb8cb084a5b4c25d22d41ebe991e0f352576c8114607",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f58a8e7c12ac2643ae1a6e90": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f58a8e7c12ac2643ae1a6e90",
      "source_handle": "P0443",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "澄清了α-多样性在ICI疗效预测中的局限性，指出其在本研究中与PFS无关，强调了特定物种丰度和β-多样性的重要性。",
        "limits": "与其他研究（如东亚人群）结果存在差异，部分源于种族背景、测序方法（16S vs 宏基因组）和参考数据库的不同。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c31875ff803ede933ad796c2326901f89f126369b513",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d59af70adbc6551785f0bb8cb084a5b4c25d22d41ebe991e0f352576c8114607",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::8854143fc8da7a3753da0fd9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8854143fc8da7a3753da0fd9",
      "source_handle": "P0443",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "所有比较组（长/短PFS、PD-L1高低、化疗处理/未处理）",
        "finding": "α-多样性（Shannon指数）在各组间均无显著差异。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c31875ff803ede933ad796c2326901f89f126369b513",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e2afc19d5dfe21d1f9c05746674a6fff11f900cf682c8255bf5c29d11fd032cc",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::dca365e90a5ce019eb2b0ecd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::dca365e90a5ce019eb2b0ecd",
      "source_handle": "P0443",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "长PFS（>6个月） vs. 短PFS（≤6个月）",
        "finding": "β-多样性存在显著差异。短PFS患者中厚壁菌门（Firmicutes）和放线菌门（Actinobacteria）丰度显著增加，F/B比率升高。长PFS患者中*Alistipes shahii*、*Alistipes finegoldii*和*Barnesiella visceriola*丰度较高；短PFS患者中*Streptococcus salivarius*、*S. vestibularis*和*Bifidobacterium breve*丰度较高。长PFS患者的菌群网络连接更紧密，具有更高的中心性。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c31875ff803ede933ad796c2326901f89f126369b513",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e2afc19d5dfe21d1f9c05746674a6fff11f900cf682c8255bf5c29d11fd032cc",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::fdf77d78260ae78820b64685": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fdf77d78260ae78820b64685",
      "source_handle": "P0443",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "PD-L1低表达 vs. PD-L1高表达",
        "finding": "β-多样性无显著差异。PD-L1低表达患者中广古菌门（Euryarchaeota）丰度显著更高。代谢通路方面，核苷酸降解、氨基酸合成和发酵通路在PD-L1低表达患者中更丰富。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c31875ff803ede933ad796c2326901f89f126369b513",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e2afc19d5dfe21d1f9c05746674a6fff11f900cf682c8255bf5c29d11fd032cc",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::0d94b1d03cfcafbfcf412a96": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0d94b1d03cfcafbfcf412a96",
      "source_handle": "P0443",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "化疗预处理（CHT-treated） vs. 一线未化疗（CHT-naive）",
        "finding": "β-多样性存在显著差异。CHT预处理改变了菌群组成，但未将其推向特定的“短PFS”或“长PFS”表型。CHT-naive患者中糖酵解通路更丰富，而CHT-treated患者中氨基酸降解和碳水化合物合成通路更丰富。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c31875ff803ede933ad796c2326901f89f126369b513",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e2afc19d5dfe21d1f9c05746674a6fff11f900cf682c8255bf5c29d11fd032cc",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::0e1c30f0af452acce36c85fc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0e1c30f0af452acce36c85fc",
      "source_handle": "P0443",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "机器学习预测效能",
        "finding": "基于分类学特征（物种）的随机森林模型预测PFS的AUC为0.74；基于代谢通路的模型预测PD-L1表达的AUC为0.87。表明分类学特征更适合预测生存结局，而代谢通路更适合预测PD-L1表型。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c31875ff803ede933ad796c2326901f89f126369b513",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "4"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e2afc19d5dfe21d1f9c05746674a6fff11f900cf682c8255bf5c29d11fd032cc",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::557f31a3e3355e0857469ce5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::557f31a3e3355e0857469ce5",
      "source_handle": "P0443",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
      "value": "empirical",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c31875ff803ede933ad796c2326901f89f126369b513",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::357fcacb4dd0ff075396f5ffadddf0aa242674548258309aa81baec2ee6bd85a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::1b9db5e9fba19073e07da37a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1b9db5e9fba19073e07da37a",
      "source_handle": "P0443",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管抗PD-1免疫治疗在部分NSCLC患者中有效，但总体响应率较低且个体差异大。现有的PD-L1生物标志物存在局限性（如超过50%的高表达患者不响应）。因此，亟需发现能够更准确预测免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效的创新性生物标志物，特别是探究肠道微生物组是否以及如何影响ICI疗效。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c31875ff803ede933ad796c2326901f89f126369b513",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c4dc9741be28222e86153789c29987408599ff33a5ede0679d8b0776fb37035c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::bf381632e4e9954b4da9150d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bf381632e4e9954b4da9150d",
      "source_handle": "P0443",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "研究对象为62名接受抗PD-1免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的晚期非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者（发现队列），以及60名来自同一机构、接受相同治疗指南的验证队列患者。研究情境聚焦于高加索人群，分析基线粪便样本中的肠道微生物组特征，并评估其与无进展生存期（PFS）、PD-L1表达状态、化疗预处理历史及药物使用（抗生素、抗酸药、类固醇）的关系。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c31875ff803ede933ad796c2326901f89f126369b513",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ed52fe98eadf441d9cd36acba7f7a370d2999b5d7ccd1489f10e41b6e7ec5833",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::43c8bd2245d1dd21101634ef": {
      "atom_id": "atom::43c8bd2245d1dd21101634ef",
      "source_handle": "P0443",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在探索肠道微生物组作为预测NSCLC患者抗PD-1免疫治疗疗效的新型生物标志物的潜力。作者利用鸟枪法宏基因组测序技术，对发现队列和验证队列患者的肠道菌群进行深度分析。研究首先比较了不同临床分组间的α-多样性和β-多样性差异，随后通过单变量和多变量统计模型（Lasso回归、Cox比例风险回归）筛选与PFS相关的特异性细菌分类群和代谢通路。最后，采用随机森林机器学习算法评估分类学特征和代谢通路在预测PFS和PD-L1表达中的效能。研究确认了特定菌属/种与PFS的关联，并揭示了微生物群落网络结构在治疗反应者与非反应者间的差异。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c31875ff803ede933ad796c2326901f89f126369b513",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7ae488d3194f34cab0ced960b3064d421618ea158996919316585accd271a5ed",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::89e1e5ca84e021688a654363": {
      "atom_id": "atom::89e1e5ca84e021688a654363",
      "source_handle": "P0443",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了关于肠道微生物组如何调节实体瘤（具体为NSCLC）中ICI疗效的详细实证数据。其核心价值在于：1）在物种水平上识别了具体的预测性菌群标志物（如*Alistipes*促进疗效，*Streptococcus*抑制疗效），并验证了其稳健性；2）通过机器学习和多变量分析，量化了微生物特征预测临床结局的能力；3）探讨了化疗预处理对菌群的影响及其与疗效的独立性；4）分析了菌群网络结构与疗效的关系。这些内容可直接用于综述中关于“微生物标志物预测效力”、“特定菌属的作用方向”以及“宿主治疗史（化疗）对微生物组的干扰”等议题。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c31875ff803ede933ad796c2326901f89f126369b513",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6e3bab1eb9d9414690139d5066eccd838cdb9d3cc5c0db7113b2f2ffc4548a85",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::f4dbf3bd1ff2fc87e04d5633": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f4dbf3bd1ff2fc87e04d5633",
      "source_handle": "P0443",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限NSCLC患者，高加索人群。PFS定义为>6个月为长，≤6个月为短。未涉及总生存期（OS）。",
        "contribution": "提供了具体的细菌分类群（物种水平）与ICI疗效（PFS）的关联证据。发现*Alistipes shahii*和*A. finegoldii*丰度高与长PFS相关，而*Streptococcus salivarius*、*S. vestibularis*和*B. breve*丰度高与短PFS相关。这些发现在独立验证队列中得到确认。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c31875ff803ede933ad796c2326901f89f126369b513",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6afceca2b41eb460d5fed75ae0ee855762f16cff547664af130260313b3556da",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c3ce83728d4bbfa83a1f7add": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c3ce83728d4bbfa83a1f7add",
      "source_handle": "P0443",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于综述中列举支持或反对特定菌属与ICI疗效正/负相关的实证案例。特别适用于讨论“哪些细菌可能促进免疫治疗响应”以及“哪些细菌可能预示耐药”。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5e5e3399117dd84e4073c31875ff803ede933ad796c2326901f89f126369b513",
