      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b52da9c89aaeaaa5b0749b6e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b52da9c89aaeaaa5b0749b6e",
      "source_handle": "P0098",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管已知肠道微生物组影响ICI疗效，但具体机制不明。本研究试图解决：肠道微生物如何与免疫系统相互作用以影响ICI的成功或irAEs的发生？特别是特定细菌类群（如拟杆菌属和瘤胃球菌科）与免疫细胞亚群变化及临床结局之间的关联。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::09134f0294f486c52a7db3f25ed0716afe29eb87d5bb6e8f1d44069e84f07d93",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::15613d5b09de0b9d50378597": {
      "atom_id": "atom::15613d5b09de0b9d50378597",
      "source_handle": "P0098",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "III期黑色素瘤患者，接受新辅助联合抗PD-1/抗CTLA-4免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗；涉及澳大利亚和荷兰队列（n=126），其中71名患者有匹配的PBMC数据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5113a62aab995a0fca61dc223cde989649ceadec6a5d608f0a65b233854e86dd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::35e128a47c0a17f95654887c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::35e128a47c0a17f95654887c",
      "source_handle": "P0098",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该研究旨在阐明肠道微生物组与免疫系统在ICI治疗中的纵向动态关系及其对疗效和免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的影响。通过对126名患者的基线和第6周粪便样本进行16S rRNA基因测序，并对71名患者的外周血单个核细胞（PBMCs）进行质谱流式细胞术分析，研究发现ICI治疗导致循环中CD8+效应记忆T细胞增加和调节性T细胞（Tregs）减少。Tregs的减少主要见于应答者，但在发生严重irAEs的患者中也观察到显著缺乏。基线拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）丰度与Tregs减少程度及严重irAEs风险正相关，而瘤胃球菌科（Ruminococcaceae）高丰度则具有保护作用并关联更好的应答。结论指出肠道微生物组可能通过影响免疫平衡的“临界点”来塑造ICI的治疗结果。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::39f0ac4a4c7cba34de94e7cb8a997e62c6ce41f7d7b75d1a4c40ebe33d365f0b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::dd6d86a68bf67719ebd3ec2e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::dd6d86a68bf67719ebd3ec2e",
      "source_handle": "P0098",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于肠道微生物组如何通过调节特定免疫细胞亚群（特别是Tregs）来影响ICI疗效和毒性的具体实证数据。它特别强调了‘双刃剑’效应：某些细菌（如拟杆菌属）既关联于免疫激活（Treg减少），也关联于过度免疫反应（严重irAEs），从而帮助解释为何微生物组能预测疗效但也伴随毒性风险。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d90c12137942e031e6a48cef52cb857f87928ce97",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6bd724179a28fdc49a9796137c61dc5af3dc79da06a51d29961b4c4029176986",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e9a325a641129db8a0e28454cc10d9988dc744a7b",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1507478a02d11cf0fbe13251ce8d61d9c17be7823616c13230386892739ca267",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::46fff116fb877592fe07c91f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::46fff116fb877592fe07c91f",
      "source_handle": "P0098",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅针对III期黑色素瘤患者，且为新辅助联合ICI治疗情境；不能直接外推至其他肿瘤类型或单药ICI治疗。",
        "contribution": "提供了特定细菌类群（拟杆菌属、瘤胃球菌科）与ICI疗效（客观缓解）及毒性（irAEs严重程度）的具体关联方向和数据支持。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
