    "atom::f891faea0d8fe7e53741a5ed": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f891faea0d8fe7e53741a5ed",
      "source_handle": "P0200",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管已知肠道微生物组与ICI反应有关，但缺乏纵向多组学研究来明确具体因素及其动态变化机制。本研究旨在识别导致治疗反应差异的具体微生物和宿主因素，并开发一种能够跨人群验证的疗效预测评分。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f785f081b25b8053f6af6b58613af5861dcbbb53a0f17057ede57f2380121f1e",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5b8e2febf7a1ec39addc301110eb43ca060095f9e934ad6fae9dfc689d451528",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9fc32fab0a091de0eb039d21": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9fc32fab0a091de0eb039d21",
      "source_handle": "P0200",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "研究对象为接受帕博利珠单抗（pembrolizumab）治疗的晚期非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者。研究情境包括内部队列（92名患者，进行纵向多组学分析）、健康对照队列（92人）以及外部公共ICI治疗队列（728人）。范围涵盖肠道微生物组、宿主转录组（RNA-seq）和全外显子组测序（WES），旨在识别影响免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效的因素。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f785f081b25b8053f6af6b58613af5861dcbbb53a0f17057ede57f2380121f1e",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5e9fdd2f2166cdc04a10a4f7b97e2c1348f7c27ab18b68c1fb287c8b50c8a899",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::be7f277a94f66204fd567864": {
      "atom_id": "atom::be7f277a94f66204fd567864",
      "source_handle": "P0200",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该研究针对肠道微生物组与ICI疗效关联中纵向多组学数据不足的现状，对92例晚期NSCLC患者进行了纵向采样和多组学分析。通过比较患者与健康人的微生物特征，并利用内部队列及728例公共数据开发并验证了一个分类评分系统。研究发现特定菌群丰度与治疗反应相关，观察到治疗过程中微生物失调的动态变化，并提出了一个结合肿瘤突变负荷（TMB）的跨人群评分以改善疗效分层。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f785f081b25b8053f6af6b58613af5861dcbbb53a0f17057ede57f2380121f1e",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9433142388503b33e1cd1bbd4056fd420c0a50e59c03da7b6f5051b5012727f2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c4515bfd87b96f002f15ae96": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c4515bfd87b96f002f15ae96",
      "source_handle": "P0200",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了关于肠道微生物组如何作为独立且互补的轴解释ICI疗效的具体实证素材。其核心价值在于纵向动态视角（治疗前后及进展期）和跨人群验证的微生物评分体系，可直接用于综述中关于“微生物标志物预测疗效”及“微生物-宿主互作动态变化”的章节。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f785f081b25b8053f6af6b58613af5861dcbbb53a0f17057ede57f2380121f1e",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6cea60d9be53ac5920b3acee77bac80cbe5150b334cc12ac4a84fee18670705f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c75ab0a7f525c3cdcfd56bcf": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c75ab0a7f525c3cdcfd56bcf",
      "source_handle": "P0200",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "结论基于NSCLC患者队列，虽结合了公共ICI数据，但主要发现仍局限于肺癌语境下的微生物特征；评分的有效性依赖于特定的标记物选择和健康状态指数。",
        "contribution": "提供了具体的微生物分类群（Faecalibacterium, Lactobacillus, Escherichia）与ICI疗效（CR/PR/SD vs PD）的关联证据，并开发了基于这些标记物比率的跨人群评分。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f785f081b25b8053f6af6b58613af5861dcbbb53a0f17057ede57f2380121f1e",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e90a8a0e67822be40f0b6716292311c26b99b4dc680f130cd1ffca38d0b4852e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::23d0850fefa5d13d154c703d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::23d0850fefa5d13d154c703d",
      "source_handle": "P0200",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于回答“哪些微生物特征与ICI疗效相关”的问题，支持综述中关于特定菌群作为疗效生物标志物的论述。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f785f081b25b8053f6af6b58613af5861dcbbb53a0f17057ede57f2380121f1e",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::96df5f153f3515761d489da763d0e0717fbcbb8deb17d2c967f8093098d61f26",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::697fab1e944be79f63331cce": {
      "atom_id": "atom::697fab1e944be79f63331cce",
      "source_handle": "P0200",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "摘要未提供具体的分子机制（如代谢产物、免疫细胞浸润等），仅描述了表型层面的动态变化和统计学关联；无法直接解释因果机制，仅能作为机制研究的背景或假设生成依据。",
        "contribution": "揭示了微生物失调的动态变化模式：反应者治疗后向健康状态回归，而进展期所有患者均出现恶化。同时指出微生物特征与TMB具有互补性。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f785f081b25b8053f6af6b58613af5861dcbbb53a0f17057ede57f2380121f1e",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e90a8a0e67822be40f0b6716292311c26b99b4dc680f130cd1ffca38d0b4852e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
