      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8beedd6224fa11a42cd0c042b68ed4968b0882fff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ac2f0b0dc46a4ef4d65d14d5c7f62eff8c65f40d24e834edda22f285ac3fcc5f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::0aeee4fa349ad6804e7718af": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0aeee4fa349ad6804e7718af",
      "source_handle": "P0415",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "既往关于肠道微生物影响免疫治疗的研究结果不一致，且多数仅关注物种丰度而未考虑功能表达，也未充分利用时间-事件数据（常二分化患者为响应者/非响应者）。本研究试图通过整合16S、宏基因组和宏转录组数据，更精确地鉴定与无进展生存期相关的特定微生物类群和功能通路，并探索其潜在的机制联系。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8beedd6224fa11a42cd0c042b68ed4968b0882fff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::071f78618d9c399bfe8537d4eb2f302d3a1f748d3c9e065530808a839dd34a81",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::29a4f46df8425be012292ee7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::29a4f46df8425be012292ee7",
      "source_handle": "P0415",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "27例接受免疫治疗（抗PD-1或抗CTLA-4）的转移性或辅助性黑色素瘤患者；研究基于治疗前粪便样本，采用16S rRNA基因测序、鸟枪法宏基因组测序及子集（n=17）的宏转录组测序；主要终点为无进展生存期（PFS）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8beedd6224fa11a42cd0c042b68ed4968b0882fff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d9e4f7d61cc75cd3b2a45e386e807c06df2cc782accc5883b706c12948b60896",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9a77bfdf071594bc0086aebd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9a77bfdf071594bc0086aebd",
      "source_handle": "P0415",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在探究肠道微生物群对黑色素瘤免疫治疗疗效的影响。通过对27名患者的治疗前粪便样本进行多组学分析，研究发现较高的微生物群落丰富度与较长的无进展生存期相关。基于整体微生物组成的聚类分析将患者分为高、中、低风险组，其中低风险组的疾病进展风险显著低于高风险组。在物种层面，拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）中的部分菌种（如B. ovatus, B. dorei）与较短的PFS相关，而粪杆菌属（Faecalibacterium）中的F. prausnitzii等则与较长的PFS相关。此外，研究首次结合宏转录组数据，识别出与PFS相关的宏基因组功能通路及其转录表达，包括L-鼠李糖降解、鸟苷核苷酸生物合成和B族维生素生物合成等风险相关通路，以及异亮氨酸生物合成等保护相关通路。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8beedd6224fa11a42cd0c042b68ed4968b0882fff",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::60620e53889a7884714a2989c1fc59b3b633c6270094438dcad927658bab98c7",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::22af4df20a3c7df492871e62": {
      "atom_id": "atom::22af4df20a3c7df492871e62",
      "source_handle": "P0415",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于肠道微生物如何调节固体肿瘤（黑色素瘤）免疫检查点抑制剂疗效的具体实证素材。其核心价值在于不仅关联了特定菌种（如Faecalibacterium vs Bacteroides）与预后，还深入到了功能层面，揭示了特定的代谢通路（氨基酸合成、维生素合成、糖降解）及其转录活性与PFS的关联，为解释“机制”提供了具体的分子线索。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8beedd6224fa11a42cd0c042b68ed4968b0882fff",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::dd27a071d42b25688420068dbb596a313b9dd14a41bd3238a8500f0d26b8c889",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::00b11793deff66a1d919563f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::00b11793deff66a1d919563f",
      "source_handle": "P0415",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限黑色素瘤患者；样本量小；未区分不同免疫药物类型的差异；关联而非因果。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物组成（丰富度、聚类分组）和特定物种丰度与免疫治疗疗效（PFS）正负向关联的具体数据。证实了较高丰富度和特定保护性菌种（如F. prausnitzii）与更好预后相关，而特定风险菌种（如B. ovatus）与较差预后相关。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8beedd6224fa11a42cd0c042b68ed4968b0882fff",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4a204cd26bc482f2bddc5fea6fd94806b6162b4f476a293730d52b9be362fc2b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::467e529f6a41e42a68010d63": {
      "atom_id": "atom::467e529f6a41e42a68010d63",
      "source_handle": "P0415",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答综述中关于“哪些微生物特征与免疫治疗疗效相关”的子问题，提供具体的菌种名单和方向性证据。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::3778ce1ca15de297b1179ec8beedd6224fa11a42cd0c042b68ed4968b0882fff",
