        {
          "record_id": "record::ddae59555ff66f6d76f4f5d45ea66eaa810856dd20f158371ed493cf2234506c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::60e9d9c4f2d193c953fb3f10dd71270b44bddd692d552045cb6f1b22c038143d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::891c061f6e1b35c8496600b9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::891c061f6e1b35c8496600b9",
      "source_handle": "P0485",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "黏膜黑色素瘤是一种罕见亚型，对ICI反应率低。本研究试图确定肠道、黏膜和肿瘤微生物组以及可改变的风险因素如何影响ICI的响应和耐药，特别是通过解析微生物组与肿瘤微环境的相互作用。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ddae59555ff66f6d76f4f5d45ea66eaa810856dd20f158371ed493cf2234506c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b4dc6c5b9df10a68b5801d24d19c4833efd9992617947d2d91d1b249c187bd8f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::99d5bdcfbf4a118d8408c980": {
      "atom_id": "atom::99d5bdcfbf4a118d8408c980",
      "source_handle": "P0485",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "黏膜黑色素瘤（MM）患者队列，涉及肠道、黏膜表面及肿瘤微环境的微生物组与宿主免疫/基因组互作；研究情境为前瞻性观察性研究，数据截至2026年5月。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ddae59555ff66f6d76f4f5d45ea66eaa810856dd20f158371ed493cf2234506c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e41521b8f1d722090c704f1f60bb79f3b0ab286a82aa3bdc09a7e1cb58193644",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::938112d9bf702269316f1024": {
      "atom_id": "atom::938112d9bf702269316f1024",
      "source_handle": "P0485",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该研究旨在阐明微生物组与肿瘤微环境相互作用如何驱动黏膜黑色素瘤对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的响应与耐药。研究在MD安德森癌症中心前瞻性纳入MM患者，收集粪便、黏膜拭子及肿瘤组织样本进行多组学分析。初步结果显示，不同原发部位的MM具有特定的微生物特征和突变谱；在接受ICI治疗的患者中，响应者与非响应者在肠道菌群组成上存在差异，且响应者肿瘤微环境中CD56和CD20表达更高。这是一项正在进行中的研究，目前提供了部分基线数据和初步关联结果。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ddae59555ff66f6d76f4f5d45ea66eaa810856dd20f158371ed493cf2234506c",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e7d3e297d557a860bf34a218d3bc30e495597f25e0ff26c869455bbfdcecaed1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::744846477697fdbc90868249": {
      "atom_id": "atom::744846477697fdbc90868249",
      "source_handle": "P0485",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于黏膜黑色素瘤这一特定实体瘤亚型中，肠道微生物组与ICI疗效关联的初步实证数据。其价值在于区分了不同解剖部位MM的微生物/基因组背景，并初步识别了与ICI响应相关的微生物组成差异及微环境免疫特征（CD56/CD20），有助于理解为何某些MM患者对ICI无响应或耐药，以及微生物组可能作为生物标志物的潜力。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ddae59555ff66f6d76f4f5d45ea66eaa810856dd20f158371ed493cf2234506c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b2216882837e6451f5675d9ec512ea1cef3c3d88f3e4a81e84d9b759d2f707d8",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3caf73fb053b6436a58289fd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3caf73fb053b6436a58289fd",
      "source_handle": "P0485",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限黏膜黑色素瘤亚型；结果为初步相关性，尚未确立因果性或普适性；样本量有限。",
        "contribution": "提供了黏膜黑色素瘤患者中，ICI响应者与非响应者之间肠道微生物组组成的具体差异证据（细菌类群存在和比例的变化）。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ddae59555ff66f6d76f4f5d45ea66eaa810856dd20f158371ed493cf2234506c",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::da952bcded933c88427264ef20889d2318f20200755863d7a0caa4903f392c7b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::a76f17cbe4fb602631ca63bd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a76f17cbe4fb602631ca63bd",
      "source_handle": "P0485",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于支持“肠道微生物组调节ICI疗效”这一观点，特别是在罕见实体瘤亚型中的具体表现。可作为微生物组作为预测生物标志物的例证。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ddae59555ff66f6d76f4f5d45ea66eaa810856dd20f158371ed493cf2234506c",
