    "atom::96f7890c6c0f6aa3553389ff": {
      "atom_id": "atom::96f7890c6c0f6aa3553389ff",
      "source_handle": "P0327",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该研究结果为阴性，不能推断肠道微生物对ICI完全无效，而是表明在当前测量条件下（基线、特定组合）无法作为独立预测因子。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2a114ae43a5c751a14df5a8e270999da7ff4923334ffd580fde228b8e8bbffd1",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4b785be74fd5fe37c61cbb1c56d79eecccb9d477fe5c7fc91633fcb90a0e663d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6f79113c11be8141e2e665af": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6f79113c11be8141e2e665af",
      "source_handle": "P0327",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "结果受限于多种ICI药物的混合使用，不同药物可能对微生物群有不同影响，结论不能简单外推至单一ICI药物。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2a114ae43a5c751a14df5a8e270999da7ff4923334ffd580fde228b8e8bbffd1",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4b785be74fd5fe37c61cbb1c56d79eecccb9d477fe5c7fc91633fcb90a0e663d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::e01cf6d45815d2847bb2cff7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e01cf6d45815d2847bb2cff7",
      "source_handle": "P0327",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "肠道通透性指标的测量方法（如Zonulin、内毒素）在不同实验室间可能存在变异，需谨慎解读其绝对数值。",
