    "atom::04a59e4f0e2135582ab01492": {
      "atom_id": "atom::04a59e4f0e2135582ab01492",
      "source_handle": "P0026",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses",
        "purpose"
      ],
      "value": "用于丰富综述对微生物组临床应用的全面理解，说明其不仅限于治疗反应预测，还涉及诊断和预后。这有助于构建更完整的微生物组在肿瘤学中作用的图景。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f7716cb6058d5ce6dc7380a56a9751c240e5f089a1cf905906778e20f3972338",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "2",
            "purpose"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::5faffef44afd82f262ce3f1347e9753cc220ab96fb590df4753e70d1cbaf59c9",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "2",
            "purpose"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4023ecdfcb5f01cc94cfc6afc000f380c5fa5e19387090777aa21747008a4660",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::92203afa91a5d08ad9c31eae": {
      "atom_id": "atom::92203afa91a5d08ad9c31eae",
      "source_handle": "P0026",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该综述是范围综述，其结论基于对20项研究的叙事综合，而非定量荟萃分析。因此，其提供的“AUC”等性能指标应视为各独立研究的结果汇总，而非经过严格统计合并的估计值。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f7716cb6058d5ce6dc7380a56a9751c240e5f089a1cf905906778e20f3972338",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::5faffef44afd82f262ce3f1347e9753cc220ab96fb590df4753e70d1cbaf59c9",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::725918eb9dd55a19b0facb1b6fbf2494cead843fb665f5b4fb5a89f6d0168415",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f144188f88dd66e6b5199a8c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f144188f88dd66e6b5199a8c",
      "source_handle": "P0026",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "综述中引用的机制解释（如免疫激活、代谢产物作用）主要来自被综述的原始文献或评论文章，并非本综述作者的新发现。在引用时需明确来源。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f7716cb6058d5ce6dc7380a56a9751c240e5f089a1cf905906778e20f3972338",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::5faffef44afd82f262ce3f1347e9753cc220ab96fb590df4753e70d1cbaf59c9",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::725918eb9dd55a19b0facb1b6fbf2494cead843fb665f5b4fb5a89f6d0168415",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2bdb542a3b579fd596759670": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2bdb542a3b579fd596759670",
      "source_handle": "P0026",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "综述强调“菌株水平”特征的重要性，但这主要基于Gunjur等(2024)的一项研究，其他多数研究停留在属或种水平。因此，菌株水平的优越性尚需更多证据支持。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f7716cb6058d5ce6dc7380a56a9751c240e5f089a1cf905906778e20f3972338",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::5faffef44afd82f262ce3f1347e9753cc220ab96fb590df4753e70d1cbaf59c9",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::725918eb9dd55a19b0facb1b6fbf2494cead843fb665f5b4fb5a89f6d0168415",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::a2fa1a7af600d3f8db94c74b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a2fa1a7af600d3f8db94c74b",
      "source_handle": "P0026",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "综述包含了一些非ICI治疗（如化疗、靶向治疗）的研究，在应用于回答ICI相关问题时，需注意区分不同治疗模式的微生物组相互作用差异。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f7716cb6058d5ce6dc7380a56a9751c240e5f089a1cf905906778e20f3972338",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::5faffef44afd82f262ce3f1347e9753cc220ab96fb590df4753e70d1cbaf59c9",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::725918eb9dd55a19b0facb1b6fbf2494cead843fb665f5b4fb5a89f6d0168415",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f33418f66f54c2ba117b589d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f33418f66f54c2ba117b589d",
      "source_handle": "P0026",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "综述指出临床转化面临巨大挑战，因此在利用其提供的积极发现（如高AUC）时，必须同时强调其探索性质和缺乏外部验证的局限性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f7716cb6058d5ce6dc7380a56a9751c240e5f089a1cf905906778e20f3972338",
          "field_path": [
